<title>USA: Gardner Denver in five-year labor pact.</title>
<headline>Gardner Denver in five-year labor pact.</headline>
<dateline>QUINCY, Ill. 1997-03-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Gardner Denver Machinery Inc said Monday the company and the International Association of Machinists and Aerospace Workers executed a five-year labor agreement that becomes effective March 31.</p>
<p>The union represents the hourly workforce at the company's plant in Quincy, Ill.</p>
<p>Gardner Venver makes air compressor and blower products for various industrial applications and pumps used in oil and gas production.</p>
<p>		((Reuters Chicago Newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
</text>
